%% function: gate_tick
stateDiagram-v2
    CLOSED --> OPEN : if box_arrived and not bin_full: open_seconds becomes 0, blocked_seconds becomes 0
    OPEN --> JAMMED : if blocked_seconds is at least 5
    OPEN --> CLOSED : otherwise, if open_seconds is at least 3
    JAMMED --> CLOSED : if reset_pressed: jams goes up by 1
    note right of OPEN : every time first: open_seconds goes up by 1, blocked_seconds becomes blocked_seconds plus 1
